OL,3,GNEWSACouple warn of parking QR code
OL,4,Ascam after #370 loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has warned other motorists to
OL,7,Fwatch out for QR code scams when paying
OL,8,Ffor parking after losing hundreds of
OL,9,Fpounds.
OL,11,FJess Hagan, 28, from Forest Hall,
OL,12,FNewcastle, said she and fiance Jake
OL,13,FFreeman, 29, lost #370 after falling
OL,14,Ffoul of a scam in North Tyneside on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FShe said they woke up the next day with
OL,18,F"a bunch of notifications from the
OL,19,Fbank", and were shocked by the
OL,20,Fattention to detail of scammers who
OL,21,Fimitated the RingGo parking app.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
