OL,3,GNEWSACouple warn of parking QR code
OL,4,Ascam after #370 loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FRingGo said it did not use QR codes on
OL,7,Fany signs to help drivers pay for
OL,8,Fparking and the codes were "a common
OL,9,Ftool for scams and fraud".
